      "payload": {
        "progress": "PR #22 open. Key reconciliation: replaced the dead session's invented cursor pagination with main's established page/limit envelope, dropped three out-of-scope sub-endpoints. Also fixed a real tree correctness gap (frontend inferred children from array length; now reads has_children/children_truncated). Follow-ups reported: detail load-more refetches whole payload; plan versions unbounded; tree limit/depth API unused by UI."
      },
      "at": "2026-08-02T22:31:28.404Z"
